{"title":" JUST A COFFEE AND A CHAT  at 55 AVENUE ROAD","startsAt":"2026-10-27T14:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-27T16:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**THIS WILL BA A BI-WEEKLY EVENT TO CHAT, LAUGH, AND GET TO KNO**W EACH OTHER. NO PRESSURE TO ATTEND - JUST VISIT OR DROP IN...(members only please) ***Be kind and rsvp so that the host knows how many tables to save.*** **Anyone that is not a member will be asked politely to leave and apply to TSSC if they so choose.**\n\nBring yourself and your sense of humor. The group can decide it's own agenda of chat after a few meetups. I know it is difficult NOT to talk about politics or religion, but we are a social group whose premise is fun! As tempting as it can be, please restrain and stick to topics less heated.\n\n**We will meet at 2PM. Please try and be on time. ENTER FROM 55** **AVENUE ROAD, DOWN THE STAIRCASE AND INTO THE FOOD COURT.**\n\nPARKING : [Avenue Road Toronto parking - free or cheap lots, garages and street meter spots (parkopedia.ca)](https://en.parkopedia.ca/parking/avenue_road_toronto/?arriving=202409231130&leaving=202409231330)\n\n**THANKS FOR HOSTING JIM!**","venue":{"name":"Yorkville Village Food Court","address":"55 Avenue Road, Downtown","lat":43.671654,"lng":-79.3946,"city":"Downtown"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Seniors Social Club","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/3/c/2/highres_522401922.jpeg"}